[gd_scene load_steps=9 format=3]

; CLUSTER MINE — thrown, bursts on landing into five submines.
;
; Deliberately the OPPOSITE silhouette to the Heavy Mine. That one is a broad
; flat puck you set down; this is a thrown canister — upright, banded, with a
; visible split line round its waist where it comes apart, and a throwing
; handle. You should never confuse which one is in your hand.
;
; One submine sits beside it at the scale it scatters at, so the whole item
; reads in a single picture: the canister and what comes out of it.
;
; House palette. No emissive.

